Each time you take damage, you roll {{cts|25|60%}} of your mental save against it.  A successful saving throw can crit and will reduce the damage by at least 50%.

The first talent point invested will also increase the amount of Psi you gain from Willpower by 0.5, but reduce the amount of life you gain from Constitution by 0.25.

The first talent point also increases your solipsism threshold by 10%.

''Note: A bug in version 1.2.3 causes critical hits to actually reduce the amount of dismissed damage rather than increase it.''
